{
  "workflowId": "300000327004566",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_FIN_AP_PAYMENT_INQUIRY_ANALYST",
  "name": "Payment Inquiry Analyst",
  "description": "Assists payables specialists in retrieving detailed payment transaction information. This analyst searches and filters data based on payment status—such as failed, voided, or rejected—as well as criteria like payment dates, numbers, and supplier details. While it facilitates efficient data retrieval, it does not modify payment records or authorize financial transfers.",
